@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="static-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
        We take your privacy seriously. This page outlines how FanHubPlus collects,
        uses, and protects the information you share with us.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
        When you create an account, we collect basic details such as your name, email
        address, and any preferences you set while using the platform, including your
        bookmarks, notes, and activity history.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>
        Your information is used to personalize your experience, show you relevant
        content and events, and improve the platform over time. We do not sell your
        personal data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
        You can update or delete your personal data at any time from your account
        settings. If you have questions about how your data is handled, reach out
        through our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
</section>
